e":{"value":"Jean de Florette","language":"fr-FR"},"originalTitle":"Jean de Florette","overview":{"value":"In a rural French village, an old man and his only remaining relative cast their covetous eyes on an adjoining vacant property. They need its spring water for growing their flowers, and are dismayed to hear that the man who has inherited it is moving in. They block up the spring and watch as their new neighbour tries to keep his crops watered from wells far afield through the hot summer. Though they see his desperate efforts are breaking his health and his wife and daughter's hearts, they think only of getting the water.","language":"en-US"},"tagline":{"value":"For some men, land and water are more precious than flesh and blood.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1986-08-27","status":"Released","rating":7.7,"ratingCount":636,"genres":["Dramma"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"122m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2565,"name":"Yves Montand","role":"César Soubeyran, aka 'le Papet'","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wewmvQm200D2jD14G4YjSmg0WVb.jpg"},{"id":16927,"name":"Gérard Depardieu","role":"Jean Cadoret, hunchback, son of Florette","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pOpHfkYRhFJiKAiIycdguQPYfem.jpg"},{"id":6012,"name":"Daniel Auteuil","role":"Ugolin Soubeyran, nephew of Papet","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5asrvkdSnlYlHap3ldDNyE5opeI.jpg"},{"id":38351,"name":"Elisabeth Depardieu","role":"Aimée Cadoret, wife of Jean","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eFwpmx5OKAU9Olqrl1OsIiP37IG.jpg"},{"id":16314,"name":"Margarita Lozano","role":"Baptistine, Piedmontese of the cave","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xsSBfAnXd6fFgf2BJPL3fXu5lyI.jpg"},{"id":38385,"name":"Ernestine Mazurowna","role":"Manon Cadoret, daughter of Jean & Aimée","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oXtJlDMemJ9HjRC6pzI0XXWnifR.jpg"},{"id":38386,"name":"Armand Meffre","role":"Philoxène, mayor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pDnIo4WCzisZPVj9LsxgOs2xVyB.jpg"},{"id":1110334,"name":"André Dupon","role":"Pamphile,  joiner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4hC5W0nwQf2Q4HYwrhClWFsYfBJ.jpg"},{"id":1892946,"name":"Pierre Nougaro","role":"Casimir","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tozWakEP0c08c4IssqEn9FQUCK4.jpg"},{"id":38387,"name":"Jean Maurel","role":"Anglade, believer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMQugNQQmWvCTkjTQiL1ANZM9uU.jpg"},{"id":55856,"name":"Roger Souza","role":"Ange, hydrant man","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7eolvKmjApuhzKeqNqnzNNhHd9.jpg"},{"id":38389,"name":"Didier Pain","role":"Eliacin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4wZFAB1dzDL9UDcYKemzsKlbeZq.jpg"},{"id":38390,"name":"Pierre-Jean Rippert","role":"Pascal, hydrant man","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nJKppy3ixwByNgbetgyJ98HoNYa.jpg"},{"id":262459,"name":"Marc Betton","role":"Martial","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eqEZmKCBIL9RvSZqy9XFYsAXpgx.jpg"},{"id":2573969,"name":"Clément Cal","role":"Méderic, bar boss"},{"id":2573971,"name":"Benedetto Bertino","role":"Giuseppe"},{"id":239367,"name":"Marcel Champel","role":"Pique-Bouffigue","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gQHF6ZCL3N5Vibg64UUjcDdyeiI.jpg"},{"id":1178455,"name":"Chantal Liennel","role":"Amandine, César Soubeyran's servant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/38IfrBMZpgYXSkfBKJ8BVhivBeh.jpg"},{"id":1376153,"name":"Fransined","role":"Florist","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vWHCtB7b7OQuhAYhBuSErJsIBYT.jpg"},{"id":3524,"name":"Marcel Berbert","role":"Notary","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ysIopNGes84lrd2UL92o8Uyrka5.jpg"},{"id":2573982,"name":"Christian Tamisier","role":"Doctor"},{"id":1149022,"name":"Jo Doumerg","role":"Muleteer"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","overview":"In a rural French village, an old man and his only remaining relative cast their covetous eyes on an adjoining vacant property. They need its spring water for growing their flowers, and are dismayed to hear that the man who has inherited it is moving in. They block up the spring and watch as their new neighbour tries to keep his crops watered from wells far afield through the hot summer. Though they see his desperate efforts are breaking his health and his wife and daughter's hearts, they think only of getting the water.","tagline":"For some men, land and water are more precious than flesh and blood."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Jean de Florette","overview":"Petit et laid, Ugolin, le dernier des Soubeyran, revient du service militaire. Il retrouve son oncle, le Papet, à qui il dévoile son projet : rester au pays pour cultiver des œillets. Convaincu que l’affaire peut être rentable, le Papet accepte de financer l’entreprise. Il faut donc trouver une terre, ensoleillée bien sûr mais surtout bien arrosée. Celle de Pique‐Bouffigue ferait l’affaire. Le Papet tente, en vain, de convaincre le vieillard irascible de lui céder son bien. Celui‐ci perd la vie dans le bref affrontement qui s’ensuit. À la surprise générale, un héritier se présente, Jean Cadoret, un bossu qu’accompagnent sa femme et sa fille…","tagline":"Pour certains hommes, la terre et l’eau sont plus précieuses que la chair et le sang."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sH9FP9Flff1bGiHkPEKCmOwnzDw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qNBxyt60hnzBRSHo1uRkRU34fYE.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":4480,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/atjyDRdOnOi2S28X3mNtJ7CQmFj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/atjyDRdOnOi2S2